    },
    {
      "entity": "obj-love-letters",
      "attribute": "tone",
      "value": "tender_urgent",
      "quote": "The first line he read—soft and without show—was not a flourish but a small command: \"Hide me in the places they do not look for me. Stay away from them, not from me.\""
